 "intro_zh": "杜米托尔国家公园美丽绝伦，它由冰川形成，地上河和地下河流经该公园。沿欧洲最深峡谷——塔拉河峡谷两侧是浓密的松林，松林中点缀着清澈的湖水，并拥有大面积的特色植物群。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "This breathtaking national park was formed by glaciers and is traversed by rivers and underground streams. Along the Tara river canyon, which has the deepest gorges in Europe, the dense pine forests are interspersed with clear lakes and harbour a wide range of endemic flora.",
